step The Theramore Docks
  tip South-east from the manor to Theramore Isle: the Captain's Footlocker lies on the sea floor off the docks on the isle's east side. Swim in and out and keep off the piers and the town: Theramore's guards are level 53-57.
  collect 5882 quest 1202.1 @71.5,51.2 map 1445 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Underwater

